msgstr "このノートブックでは、`gwexpy` の `ScalarField` クラスの基本的な使い方を学びます。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10006
#: ac8c18d9241540f08758e0e9b3f236ed
msgid "What is ScalarField?"
msgstr "ScalarField とは？"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10008
#: 45f972f0df8a47669da37adbb92802c2
msgid ""
"`ScalarField` is a specialized class for handling 4-dimensional data "
"consisting of time and 3D space. It represents the spacetime structure of "
"physical fields and provides the following features:"
msgstr ""
"`ScalarField` は、時間と3次元空間の4次元データを扱うための特殊なクラスです。物理場の時空間構造を表現し、以下の機能を提供します："

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10010
#: 3aedcef8085d4d7d8af36772c8d2564f
msgid "**Axis 0 (time axis)**: Time domain ↔ Frequency domain transformations"
msgstr "**軸0（時間軸）**: 時間ドメイン ↔ 周波数ドメインの変換"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10011
#: 1fd72fcd7bc04ec694c1894df07f513a
msgid ""
"**Axes 1-3 (spatial axes)**: Real space ↔ K-space (wavenumber space) "
"transformations"
msgstr "**軸1-3（空間軸）**: 実空間 ↔ K空間（波数空間）の変換"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10012
#: 673511ce31264400bc06eade3c0553f4
msgid ""
"**4D structure preservation**: Always maintains 4 dimensions even when "
"sliced"
msgstr "**4D構造の保持**: スライシングしても常に4次元を維持"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10013
#: 891d9ed048844d54980eb7cc11bb0279
msgid ""
"**Batch operations**: Bulk processing of multiple fields using `FieldList` "
"and `FieldDict`"
msgstr "**バッチ操作**: `FieldList` と `FieldDict` による複数フィールドの一括処理"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10014
#: 51c0c8523cd64e3cab99f552e36fb03f
msgid ""
"**Signal processing**: PSD calculation, frequency-space mapping, cross-"
"correlation, coherence maps"
msgstr "**信号処理**: PSD計算、周波数-空間マッピング、相互相関、コヒーレンスマップ"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10016
#: eb5d517628c5452e8bb56122e109c8e2
